Getty Union List of Artist Names (ULAN)
----------------------------------------

Used to reconcile artist name variants across the catalogue (e.g.
recognizing "Rembrandt van Rijn" and "Rijn, Rembrandt van" as the same
person) — see data/reference/README.md for how, and
scripts/extract_ulan_artists.mjs for the extraction process. The raw ULAN
dump itself is not committed to this repository (see
data/reference/raw/.gitignore); only the derived artist-name mapping is.

